'''Diancie and the Cocoon of Destruction''' (Japanese: '''{{tt|破壊|はかい}}の{{tt|繭|まゆ}}とディアンシー''' ''The Cocoon of Destruction and Diancie'') is the {{pkmn|manga}} adaptation of the [[M17|movie of the same name]]. It is adapted by 北村謙次 Kenji Kitamura.

